# the controls: PLAY pauses (and the night with it), REC buys a round (once an hour), EDIT calls a tune
# between tunes, a key sets the next tune's key, the knobs mix, SAVE saves
wait 300
wait 15000
expect sess 1
# PLAY: quiet, and the clock stops
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect playing 0
expect minute 1
wait 20000
expect minute 1
shot paused.png
tap PLAY
wait 500
expect playing 1
# REC: a round for the house: every glass full
tap REC
wait 300
expect thirst3 0
expect drinks3 1
shot round.png
# again within the hour: Hugh says no
tap REC
wait 300
expect drinks3 1
# the knobs: the Mix page from any page
tap FX
wait 100
expect view 3
expect par0 >0
turn K1 -80
wait 200
expect par0 0
turn K1 30
wait 200
expect par0 30
shot mix.png
# a knob on the tavern page goes to the mix
tap HOME
wait 100
turn K3 -5
wait 200
expect view 3
tap HOME
wait 100
# EDIT during a tune: "another after this!"; the room held between tunes, EDIT calls one at once, and a
# key (w1: G) picks its key
tap EDIT
wait 300
endtune
hold 600000
wait 150000
expect wstate 0
expect sess 0
tapkey w1
wait 200
tap EDIT
wait 3000
expect wstate 1
expect sess 1
expect root 7
shot called.png
# the help card: a button held; SAVE saves
press SAVE
wait 1200
shot help.png
release SAVE
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect dirty 0
